<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Báo Cáo Điều Hành — Xuân Cương 2025</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Be+Vietnam+Pro:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,600;9..144,700;9..144,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --ink:      #111827;
      --bg:       #f5f4f0;
      --white:    #ffffff;
      --g-dark:   #064e3b;
      --g-mid:    #059669;
      --g-lt:     #d1fae5;
      --r-dark:   #991b1b;
      --r-mid:    #dc2626;
      --r-lt:     #fee2e2;
      --b-dark:   #1e3a8a;
      --b-mid:    #2563eb;
      --b-lt:     #dbeafe;
      --o-mid:    #d97706;
      --o-lt:     #fef3c7;
      --p-mid:    #7c3aed;
      --p-lt:     #ede9fe;
      --line:     #e5e7eb;
      --muted:    #6b7280;
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; }

    /* COVER */
    .cover { background: var(--ink); color: white; padding: 70px 80px 60px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .cover::before { content:''; position:absolute; top:0; right:0; width:520px; height:100%; background:linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 40%, rgba(5,150,105,0.18) 100%); pointer-events:none; }
    .cover-eyebrow { font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:2.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4); margin-bottom:24px; }
    .cover h1 { font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:52px; font-weight:900; line-height:1.1; max-width:780px; margin-bottom:20px; }
    .cover h1 em { font-style:normal; color:#34d399; }
    .cover-lead { font-size:16px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); max-width:620px; line-height:1.85; margin-bottom:48px; }
    .cover-stats { display:flex; gap:0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding-top:36px; }
    .cs-item { flex:1; padding:0 28px 0 0; border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); margin-right:28px; }
    .cs-item:last-child { border-right:none; margin-right:0; }
    .cs-num { font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:38px; font-weight:700; line-height:1; }
    .cs-num.red { color:#f87171; } .cs-num.amber { color:#fbbf24; } .cs-num.green { color:#34d399; } .cs-num.white { color:#fff; }
    .cs-label { font-size:11px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4); margin-top:8px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:1px; }

    /* STATUS BAR */
    .status-bar { background:#0d1f13; padding:12px 80px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0; }
    .sb-item { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:0 24px 0 0; margin-right:24px; border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45); }
    .sb-item:last-child { border-right:none; }
    .sb-item strong { color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8); }
    .dot { width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; }
    .dot.red { background:#ef4444; } .dot.green { background:#10b981; }

    /* LAYOUT */
    .body-wrap { max-width:1160px; margin:0 auto; padding:64px 60px 100px; }

    /* CHAPTER */
    .chapter { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:20px; margin-bottom:40px; }
    .ch-num { font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:68px; font-weight:900; color:#e5e7eb; line-height:1; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:-8px; user-select:none; }
    .ch-body h2 { font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:28px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:6px; }
    .ch-body p { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); max-width:680px; }
    section { margin-bottom:80px; }
    .divider { height:1px; background:var(--line); margin:72px 0; }

    /* PROBLEM CARDS */
    .prob-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:16px; margin-bottom:20px; }
    .prob-grid.two { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }
    .prob-card { background:white; border-radius:20px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
    .prob-bar { height:5px; }
    .prob-inner { padding:24px 24px 22px; }
    .prob-tag { display:inline-block; padding:3px 10px; border-radius:99px; font-size:10px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:12px; }
    .tag-red { background:var(--r-lt); color:var(--r-dark); }
    .tag-amber { background:var(--o-lt); color:#92400e; }
    .prob-card h3 { font-size:15px; font-weight:800; line-height:1.35; margin-bottom:10px; }
    .prob-card p { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.75; }
    .prob-metric { margin-top:16px; padding:13px 15px; border-radius:12px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; }
    .pm-val { font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:30px; font-weight:700; }
    .pm-desc { font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); max-width:120px; text-align:right; line-height:1.5; }

    /* CALLOUT */
    .callout { display:flex; gap:16px; align-items:flex-start; padding:18px 22px; border-radius:14px; margin-bottom:16px; }
    .callout.red { background:var(--r-lt); border-left:4px solid var(--r-mid); }
    .callout.amber { background:var(--o-lt); border-left:4px solid var(--o-mid); }
    .callout.green { background:var(--g-lt); border-left:4px solid var(--g-mid); }
    .callout.blue { background:var(--b-lt); border-left:4px solid var(--b-mid); }
    .cl-icon { font-size:18px; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:3px; }
    .cl-body strong { font-size:14px; font-weight:700; display:block; margin-bottom:5px; }
    .cl-body p { font-size:13px; color:#374151; line-height:1.75; }

    /* ROOT CAUSE */
    .rc-list { position:relative; padding-left:34px; }
    .rc-list::before { content:''; position:absolute; left:10px; top:8px; width:2px; height:calc(100% - 24px); background:linear-gradient(to bottom,var(--r-mid),var(--o-lt)); }
    .rc-item { position:relative; margin-bottom:18px; }
    .rc-dot { position:absolute; left:-34px; top:5px; width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:9px; font-weight:800; color:white; }
    .rc-card { background:white; border-radius:12px; padding:16px 18px; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
    .rc-card-title { font-size:13px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:5px; }
    .rc-card-body { font-size:12px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; }
    .rc-card-badge { margin-top:8px; }

    /* BADGE */
    .badge { display:inline-block; padding:2px 9px; border-radius:99px; font-size:10px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:0.3px; }
    .b-red { background:var(--r-lt); color:var(--r-dark); }
    .b-amber { background:var(--o-lt); color:#92400e; }
    .b-green { background:var(--g-lt); color:var(--g-dark); }
    .b-blue { background:var(--b-lt); color:var(--b-dark); }
    .b-purple { background:var(--p-lt); color:#5b21b6; }

    /* SOLUTION CARDS */
    .sol-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:20px; margin-bottom:20px; }
    .sol-card { background:white; border-radius:18px; padding:26px; border-top:5px solid; box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
    .sol-card.green { border-color:var(--g-mid); }
    .sol-card.blue { border-color:var(--b-mid); }
    .sol-card.orange { border-color:var(--o-mid); }
    .sol-card.purple { border-color:var(--p-mid); }
    .sol-card.red { border-color:var(--r-mid); }
    .sol-card.teal { border-color:#0d9488; }
    .sol-num { font-size:10px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:8px; }
    .sol-num.green { color:var(--g-mid); } .sol-num.blue { color:var(--b-mid); } .sol-num.orange { color:var(--o-mid); }
    .sol-num.purple { color:var(--p-mid); } .sol-num.red { color:var(--r-mid); } .sol-num.teal { color:#0d9488; }
    .sol-card h3 { font-size:17px; font-weight:800; line-height:1.3; margin-bottom:10px; }
    .sol-card p { font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.75; margin-bottom:12px; }
    .sol-steps { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:7px; margin-bottom:14px; }
    .sol-step { display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.5; }
    .sol-bullet { width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0; margin-top:7px; }
    .bg-green { background:var(--g-mid); } .bg-blue { background:var(--b-mid); } .bg-orange { background:var(--o-mid); }
    .bg-purple { background:var(--p-mid); } .bg-red { background:var(--r-mid); } .bg-teal { background:#0d9488; }
    .sol-kpi { padding:13px 15px; border-radius:10px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; }
    .sol-kpi.green { background:var(--g-lt); } .sol-kpi.blue { background:var(--b-lt); }
    .sol-kpi.orange { background:var(--o-lt); } .sol-kpi.purple { background:var(--p-lt); }
    .sol-kpi.red { background:var(--r-lt); } .sol-kpi.teal { background:#ccfbf1; }
    .skpi-val { font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:20px; font-weight:700; }
    .skpi-val.green { color:var(--g-dark); } .skpi-val.blue { color:var(--b-dark); }
    .skpi-val.orange { color:#92400e; } .skpi-val.purple { color:#5b21b6; }
    .skpi-val.red { color:var(--r-dark); } .skpi-val.teal { color:#0f766e; }
    .skpi-label { font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); text-align:right; max-width:130px; line-height:1.4; }

    /* EVAL TABLE */
    .eval-wrap { background:white; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
    .eval-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; }
    .eval-table th { background:var(--ink); color:white; padding:13px 16px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px; text-align:left; }
    .eval-table td { padding:13px 16px; font-size:13px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); vertical-align:middle; }
    .eval-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom:none; }
    .eval-table tr:hover td { background:#fafaf8; }
    .stars { color:#ca8a04; letter-spacing:-1px; font-size:13px; }
    .stars-empty { color:#e5e7eb; letter-spacing:-1px; font-size:13px; }

    /* ROADMAP */
    .phase-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:152px 1fr; gap:20px; margin-bottom:28px; }
    .phase-label { display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:22px 14px; border-radius:14px; text-align:center; color:white; }
    .phase-label.p1 { background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--g-dark),var(--g-mid)); }
    .phase-label.p2 { background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--b-dark),var(--b-mid)); }
    .phase-label.p3 { background:linear-gradient(160deg,#4c1d95,var(--p-mid)); }
    .pl-phase { font-size:9px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; opacity:0.65; margin-bottom:6px; }
    .pl-days { font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:24px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.1; margin-bottom:4px; }
    .pl-tag { font-size:10px; opacity:0.6; line-height:1.4; }
    .phase-content { background:white; border-radius:14px; padding:22px 26px; box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
    .pc-title { font-size:16px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:14px; }
    .pc-items { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:8px; margin-bottom:16px; }
    .pc-item { display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-start; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.5; }
    .pc-kpis { display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
    .pc-kpi { padding:7px 14px; border-radius:8px; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; }
    .pk-green { background:var(--g-lt); color:var(--g-dark); }
    .pk-blue { background:var(--b-lt); color:var(--b-dark); }
    .pk-purple { background:var(--p-lt); color:#5b21b6; }

    /* BEFORE/AFTER */
    .ba-table { width:100%; background:white; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); margin-bottom:28px; }
    .ba-header { display:grid; grid-template-columns:2.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; background:var(--ink); color:white; padding:13px 20px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px; gap:8px; }
    .ba-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:2.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; padding:14px 20px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); align-items:center; gap:8px; }
    .ba-row:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
    .ba-row:hover { background:#fafaf8; }
    .ba-metric { font-weight:600; font-size:14px; }
    .ba-metric small { display:block; font-size:11px; color:var(--muted); font-weight:400; margin-top:2px; }
    .ba-val { text-align:center; font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; }
    .ba-val.bad { color:var(--r-mid); } .ba-val.good { color:var(--g-mid); } .ba-val.neu { color:var(--b-mid); }
    .ba-delta { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
    .dp { display:inline-block; padding:4px 11px; border-radius:99px; font-size:12px; font-weight:800; }
    .dp-pos { background:var(--g-lt); color:var(--g-dark); } .dp-neg { background:var(--r-lt); color:var(--r-dark); }

    /* OUTCOME */
    .outcome { background:var(--ink); border-radius:22px; padding:52px 60px; color:white; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
    .outcome::before { content:''; position:absolute; right:-80px; top:-80px; width:360px; height:360px; border-radius:50%; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(5,150,105,0.2) 0%, transparent 70%); }
    .outcome-label { font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:3px; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35); margin-bottom:12px; }
    .outcome h3 { font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:26px; font-weight:700; max-width:640px; line-height:1.45; margin-bottom:36px; }
    .outcome-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); gap:10px; }
    .oc-item { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); border-radius:12px; padding:18px 12px; text-align:center; }
    .oc-num { font-family:'Fraunces',serif; font-size:32px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px; }
    .oc-desc { font-size:12px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55); line-height:1.5; }

    /* FI ANIMATION */
    .fi { opacity:0; transform:translateY(20px); transition:opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease; }
    .fi.in { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }

    @media print {
      .cover { padding:48px 56px; }
      .status-bar, .body-wrap { padding:40px 48px; }
      section { page-break-inside:avoid; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ═══ COVER ═══ -->
<div class="cover">
  <div class="cover-eyebrow">Báo Cáo Điều Hành · Cửa Khẩu Xuân Cương · Tháng 5 / 2026</div>
  <h1>Báo cáo vận hành —<br/>Vấn Đề, Giải Pháp</h1>
  <p class="cover-lead">Phân tích toàn diện từ dữ liệu thực vận hành 2024–2026. Chỉ ra 4 vấn đề cốt lõi, phân tích 9 khách hàng trọng điểm.</p>
  <div class="cover-stats">
    <div class="cs-item"><div class="cs-num red">94.4%</div><div class="cs-label">Thời gian xe đang CHỜ</div></div>
    <div class="cs-item"><div class="cs-num amber">18.45%</div><div class="cs-label">Tỷ lệ xe ghép 2025</div></div>
    <div class="cs-item"><div class="cs-num red">448K</div><div class="cs-label">Tổng xe 2025 (All time)</div></div>
    <div class="cs-item"><div class="cs-num red">8.51h</div><div class="cs-label">Xe TQ chờ đủ điều kiện</div></div>
    <div class="cs-item"><div class="cs-num white">9 KH</div><div class="cs-label">Khách hàng trọng điểm phân tích</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="status-bar">
  <div class="sb-item"><div class="dot red"></div><strong>Cần hành động ngay</strong></div>
  <div class="sb-item">Dữ liệu: <strong>2024–2025 · 448K+ lượt xe</strong></div>
  <div class="sb-item">Chuẩn bị: <strong>Phạm Thị Hương</strong></div>
  <div class="sb-item"><div class="dot green"></div><strong>Bản Tổng Quát BGĐ</strong></div>
</div>

<!-- ═══ BODY ═══ -->
<div class="body-wrap">

  <!-- ══════ PHẦN I: VẤN ĐỀ ══════ -->
  <section class="fi">
    <div class="chapter">
      <div class="ch-num">01</div>
      <div class="ch-body">
        <h2>Vấn Đề Đang Gặp Phải</h2>
        <p>Vấn đề và Nguyên nhân</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 vấn đề chính -->
    <div class="prob-grid">
      <div class="prob-card">
        <div class="prob-bar" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#dc2626,#ef4444);"></div>
        <div class="prob-inner">
          <div class="prob-tag tag-red">🔴 Vấn đề #1 — Nghiêm trọng</div>
          <h3>Hệ thống không có điều phối real-time</h3>
          <p>Dashboard chỉ phục vụ báo cáo hậu kỳ. Không có cảnh báo, không theo dõi trạng thái xe tức thời. Điều phối viên không nhìn thấy vấn đề đang xảy ra để can thiệp — hệ thống vận hành hoàn toàn bị động.</p>
          <div class="prob-metric" style="background:#fef2f2;">
            <div><div class="pm-val" style="color:#dc2626;">94.4%</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;">thời gian xe đang CHỜ</div></div>
            <div class="pm-desc">Chỉ 5.6% thời gian là thực hiện dịch vụ tạo giá trị</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prob-card">
        <div class="prob-bar" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d97706,#f59e0b);"></div>
        <div class="prob-inner">
          <div class="prob-tag tag-amber">🟡 Vấn đề #2 — Cơ hội lớn bị bỏ ngỏ</div>
          <h3>Tỷ lệ xe ghép thấp, matching hoàn toàn thủ công</h3>
          <p>Ghép xe TQ–VN dựa vào kinh nghiệm cá nhân, không có thuật toán. Tỷ lệ 16.91% thấp hơn tiềm năng thực tế. Xe TQ chờ ghép lâu hơn xe VN 0.27h và 13.23% xe TQ chờ ghép trên 4 giờ.</p>
          <div class="prob-metric" style="background:#fef3c7;">
            <div><div class="pm-val" style="color:#d97706;">16.91%</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;">tỷ lệ xe ghép hiện tại</div></div>
            <div class="pm-desc">Tiềm năng có thể đạt 25%+ trong 90 ngày</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="prob-card">
        <div class="prob-bar" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#dc2626,#f97316);"></div>
        <div class="prob-inner">
          <div class="prob-tag tag-red">🔴 Vấn đề #3 — Các nút thắt cần xử lý ngay</div>
          <h3>Xe TQ chờ "đủ điều kiện sang tải" trung bình 8.51h</h3>
          <p>Đây là điểm tiêu hao thời gian lớn nhất toàn hệ thống — lớn hơn tổng chờ sang tải (0.71h) và thực hiện DV. 28.27% xe chờ 4–12h; 15.75% chờ 12–24h. Chi phí xử lý thấp nhưng tác động cực lớn.</p>
          <div class="prob-metric" style="background:#fef2f2;">
            <div><div class="pm-val" style="color:#dc2626;">8.51h</div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;">TB chờ đủ điều kiện (xe TQ)</div></div>
            <div class="pm-desc">ROI cao nhất: chi phí thấp, tác động tức thì</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="prob-grid two" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;">
      <div class="prob-card">
        <div class="prob-bar" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d97706,#d97706);"></div>
        <div class="prob-inner">
